## Why the split

The code is meant to be reused under the AGPL. The content is a large body of
hand-written copy in four languages, and it is the part a scraper would lift
to stand up a duplicate site. Two licences keep the code open without making
that free.

If you want to use some of the content, open an issue and ask. The answer is
often yes.
